  "hypothesis_statement": "For every frozen question with a non-empty known-counter set, the frozen COUNTER-authority channel reaches at least one known contrary/limiting authority from EACH of the FR, DE and IT counter queries of the frozen retrieval benchmark. I.e. the independent adversarial counter pass, issued in any single one of the three official languages, does not lose all known counter authority for that question. This is the cut the Master Prompt's adversarial research requirement depends on and it is NOT what the accepted suite measures: the accepted counter gate pools all three languages (90 counter rows of 240), while the accepted per-language gates cover the BASELINE channel only.",
